+Show the Configuration
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+The ``config`` command will print the loaded configuration values as JSON.
+Sensitive values (containing SECRET, PASSWORD, TOKEN, or KEY) will be
+masked.
+
+.. code-block:: text
+
+    $ flask config
+
+
